{"version":1,"content":"<p>影帝梁朝偉向來熱愛帆船，曾出戰香港的春季帆船賽並勇奪亞軍，更曾遠赴匈牙利參加歐洲錦標賽。</p><p>近日他以活動大使身份出席「2027香港Dragon級別帆船世界錦標賽」開幕儀式，他在台上致詞時表示，歡迎各國好手將技術與熱情帶到香港，祝願所有船隊一帆風</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:17:36.840343+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:10:41.316790+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:10:41.316790+00:00","content_hash":"7470202ed8c53286f3bc6f04df4ed274c791f236c88f2f51e6c7f5ae4e01dc04","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}